        "title": "Checking an access permission",
        "titleZh": "確認存取權限",
        "topic": "technology",
        "passage": "Man: I can open the project folder, but I cannot upload the validation report. Is the server down?\nWoman: The server is running. Your account may have read-only access. Have you just joined this project?\nMan: Yes, this week. My manager asked me to add the report before the review meeting.\nWoman: Please send me two things: the folder name and a copy of your manager's approval. I can request write access from the administrator.",
        "passageZh": "男：我能開啟專案資料夾，但無法上傳驗證報告。伺服器當機了嗎？\n女：伺服器正在運作。你的帳號可能只有唯讀權限。你剛加入這個專案嗎？\n男：是，這個星期。主管要我在審查會議前加入報告。\n女：請寄給我兩樣東西：資料夾名稱和一份主管的核准紀錄。我可以向管理員申請寫入權限。",
        "audioScript": "I can open the project folder, but I cannot upload the validation report. Is the server down?\nThe server is running. Your account may have read-only access. Have you just joined this project?\nYes, this week. My manager asked me to add the report before the review meeting.\nPlease send me two things: the folder name and a copy of your manager's approval. I can request write access from the administrator.",
        "turns": [
          {
            "voice": "male",
            "text": "I can open the project folder, but I cannot upload the validation report. Is the server down?"
          },
          {
            "voice": "female",
            "text": "The server is running. Your account may have read-only access. Have you just joined this project?"
          },
          {
            "voice": "male",
            "text": "Yes, this week. My manager asked me to add the report before the review meeting."
          },
          {
            "voice": "female",
            "text": "Please send me two things: the folder name and a copy of your manager's approval. I can request write access from the administrator."
          }
        ],
